    "title": "Luke Keaschall sparks Twins rout with four-hit night - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 hours ago Keaschall did a little of everything as Minnesota steamrolled Texas. After Friday's win over Texas, Keaschall is slashing .281/.369/.402 with 10 home runs, 81 runs scored, 52 RBI, 20 stolen bases, a .345 wOBA, and a .318 BABIP across 150 games. He's been on fire of late, hitting .310 with one homer, seven RBI, and two steals over his past seven contests. Read full article",
